0..73 Comment "// Generative functors, after ML\'s generative module semantics (Rossberg,"
74..145 Comment "// Russo and Dreyer, _F-ing Modules_, doi:10.1017/S0956796814000264): a"
146..222 Comment "// functor applied twice to one argument mints a fresh abstract type at each"
223..294 Comment "// application, and each application\'s members run through the argument"
295..319 Comment "// they were built from."
